sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant API as FastAPI app.py
    participant Schema as Person schema
    participant Predictor as steps.predict
    participant Bundle as model.pkl

    Note over API,Bundle: The bundle is loaded once when the API starts.
    Caller->>API: POST /predict with 6 fields
    API->>Schema: Validate values and ranges
    alt Invalid input
        Schema-->>Caller: 422 with a reason
    else Valid input
        API->>Predictor: predict_records(person)
        Predictor->>Bundle: Read column order and flags
        Predictor->>Predictor: Build typed DataFrame
        Predictor->>Bundle: model.predict(frame)
        Bundle-->>Predictor: Value in model space
        Predictor->>Predictor: expm1 if log target
        Predictor-->>Caller: Premium in USD + model name
    end
